		"description": "Complete test collection for every implemented route in the Mini-Jira NestJS backend.\n\nGenerated 2026-05-21 from source controller scan.\n\n**Setup**: Set the `baseUrl` variable (default `http://localhost:3000`) and `bearerToken` after logging in.",
